! adaptive-ban added a duplicate ban rule on every run with dash as /bin/sh
! traffic-accounting-helper duplicated entries of multi-IP hosts and ignored new hosts
* Have install.sh merge settings from existing *.conf files when conf-files are updated
! NAT_FORWARD_* also accepted direct connections to the forwarded host
